    "title": "Police cars, shell casings surround metro Atlanta home - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sabrina Castro ,\n32 minutes ago At least 10 police cars have surrounded a home in DeKalb County.\n[DOWNLOAD: Free WSB-TV News app for alerts as news breaks ]\nA Channel 2 Action News photographer is on scene and observed North Decatur Road blocked off with crime scene tape.\nThere are also dozens of shell casings with evidence markers nearby.\nA group of bystanders gathered near the scene, hugging and forming a prayer circle.\nIt’s not yet clear if there are any injuries or what led to the shots fired.\nThis is a developing story. We will bring you the latest updates on Channel 2 Actions News This Morning starting at 4 a.m.\nTRENDING STORIES:\n[SIGN UP: WSB-TV Daily Headlines Newsletter ]",
